      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.gwynnsislandproject.com/history"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "In 1866, the 500‑acre Gwynnsville plantation was subdivided by Gloucester County Duttons.",
